Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='scaleanchors', at=datetime(2026, 9, 9, 0, 0, 0), actor='owner', title='The fulfillment scale has anchors: 10% life at stake this hour, 20% a catastrophe tomorrow', body='*THE SCALE HAS ANCHORS* (the owner, 2026-09-09: 10% is an emergency where life is at stake this hour; 20% is a catastrophe that lands tomorrow). 10: life-threatening, this hour. 20: an irreversible legal or financial blow tomorrow. 35–45: a real consequence within weeks (a government filing). 50–65: work that matters this month. 70–85: errands, forms, habits. 90+: parked. Every writer — the triage agent, the secretary, this session — prices against the table in OPERATOR.md and SECRETARY.md, never by feel.', rationale='The owner, 2026-09-09: "10% is an emergency where life is at stake this hour; 20% is a catastrophe that lands tomorrow".', supersedes=()))